{"title":"Updates","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Updates","toc":false},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\nA glimpse into our fieldwork, research activities, and the people behind the science.\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"updates-list\">\n\n  <div class=\"update-item\">\n    <div class=\"update-date\">August 2026</div>\n    <div class=\"update-content\">\n      <h3>Airborne campaign in the Nebraska Sandhills</h3>\n      <p>Setting up calibration tarps for airborne imaging spectrascopy data collection at the Barta Brothers Ranch.</p>\n      <img src=\"images/updates/Tarps_Barta.jpeg\"\n           alt=\"Barta Tarps\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"update-item\">\n    <div class=\"update-date\">June 2026</div>\n    <div class=\"update-content\">\n      <h3>Grassland fieldwork</h3>\n      <p>Serge collects field spectroscopy measurements at the ENREEC LTAR pasture site.</p>\n      <img src=\"images/updates/SergeLTAR.jpeg\"\n           alt=\"Grassland fieldwork\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"update-item\">\n    <div class=\"update-date\">June 2026</div>\n    <div class=\"update-content\">\n      <h3>Abbey joined the group</h3>\n      <p>Abigail (Abbey) Hightower joined the group as a new M.Sc. student. Welcome Abbey!</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"update-item\">\n    <div class=\"update-date\">April 2026</div>\n    <div class=\"update-content\">\n      <h3>Serge successfully defended his M.Sc. thesis</h3>\n      <p>CONGRATULATIONS to Serge on successfully defending his M.Sc. thesis! He will continue his studies at UNL as a Ph.D. student.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"update-item\">\n    <div class=\"update-date\">December 2025</div>\n    <div class=\"update-content\">\n      <h3>Serge presented at AGU</h3>\n      <p>Serge presented his research at the 2025 AGU Fall Meeting in New Orleans.</p>\n      <img src=\"images/updates/SergeAGU25.jpeg\"\n           alt=\"Serge AGU25\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n```","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\nA glimpse into our fieldwork, research activities, and the people behind the science.\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"updates-list\">\n\n  <div class=\"update-item\">\n    <div class=\"update-date\">August 2026</div>\n    <div class=\"update-content\">\n      <h3>Airborne campaign in the Nebraska Sandhills</h3>\n      <p>Setting up calibration tarps for airborne imaging spectrascopy data collection at the Barta Brothers Ranch.</p>\n      <img src=\"images/updates/Tarps_Barta.jpeg\"\n           alt=\"Barta Tarps\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"update-item\">\n    <div class=\"update-date\">June 2026</div>\n    <div class=\"update-content\">\n      <h3>Grassland fieldwork</h3>\n      <p>Serge collects field spectroscopy measurements at the ENREEC LTAR pasture site.</p>\n      <img src=\"images/updates/SergeLTAR.jpeg\"\n           alt=\"Grassland fieldwork\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"update-item\">\n    <div class=\"update-date\">June 2026</div>\n    <div class=\"update-content\">\n      <h3>Abbey joined the group</h3>\n      <p>Abigail (Abbey) Hightower joined the group as a new M.Sc. student. Welcome Abbey!</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"update-item\">\n    <div class=\"update-date\">April 2026</div>\n    <div class=\"update-content\">\n      <h3>Serge successfully defended his M.Sc. thesis</h3>\n      <p>CONGRATULATIONS to Serge on successfully defending his M.Sc. thesis! He will continue his studies at UNL as a Ph.D. student.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"update-item\">\n    <div class=\"update-date\">December 2025</div>\n    <div class=\"update-content\">\n      <h3>Serge presented at AGU</h3>\n      <p>Serge presented his research at the 2025 AGU Fall Meeting in New Orleans.</p>\n      <img src=\"images/updates/SergeAGU25.jpeg\"\n           alt=\"Serge AGU25\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n```"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"ex